OpenChamber built-in: Server Browser

This built-in's service engine is adapted from the community extension
openchamber-server-browser (MIT), which itself adapted browser backend code
from OpenChamber:
  https://github.com/JosueGalRe/openchamber-server-browser
  https://github.com/openchamber/openchamber (PR #3425)

Source used for this move: https://github.com/rubimpassos/openchamber-server-browser
(branch feat/phase1, commit 4794b4c).

